			description: [
				"&e&lSolar Flux Reborn.&r The one resource a floating island has in unlimited supply is unobstructed sky."
				""
				"&7Eight panel tiers, six cell tiers, and an upgrade system that keeps early panels useful long after you have outgrown them. No fuel, no water, no ash - place them on the roof and forget they exist.&r"
				""
				"&8It stops at night. Pair it with a buffer or a fuel generator and it will quietly carry your base's baseline load forever."
