				""
				"&eSolar Flux Reborn&r turns that into power, and unlike vanilla-style solars it scales all the way up - eight tiers, each a straight upgrade of the last, with &eupgrade&r slots for capacity, efficiency and dispersion so a panel you place now stays useful much later."
