			description: [
				"&ePhotovoltaic Cells&r are what each solar panel tier is built around - six cell tiers feeding eight panel tiers."
				""
				"&e&lEach cell is crafted from the one below it&r, so the ladder is cumulative. Budget for that: a tier-6 cell contains every cell beneath it."
				""
				"&7Blazing Coating, Emerald Glass and Ender Glass are the other inputs as you climb. Ender Glass in particular means ender pearls, which on a void island means a Neural Networks enderman model or Mystical Agriculture.&r"
