		{
			dependencies: ["7D00000000000002"]
			description: [
				"Solar Flux panels run &7sp_1&r through &7sp_8&r, and unlike most solar mods the top tiers are genuinely worth having - the ladder does not flatten out."
				""
				"&e&lUpgrade in place.&r A higher-tier panel can be crafted around a lower one, so panels you place now are not wasted when you climb."
				""
				"&c&lThey produce nothing at night and less in bad weather.&r Pair the array with an Energy Cell sized to carry your base until dawn, or run Powah Furnators alongside to cover the gap."
				""
				"&7A floating island is close to the ideal site - nothing shadows anything, so every panel runs at full output all day.&r"
			]
			icon: "solarflux:sp_4"
			id: "7D00000000000003"
			rewards: [{
