			description: [
				"A &eMirror&r placed near a panel reflects extra sunlight into it, raising that panel's output."
				""
				"&e&lMirrors are far cheaper than panels&r, so ringing one high-tier panel with mirrors is usually better value than placing several more panels."
				""
				"&7They need line of sight to the panel and to the sky. On a flat roof they work; tucked between blocks they do nothing.&r"
