				"&e&lA full Solar Flux array asks nothing of you again.&r No fuel, no water, no waste, no maintenance."
				""
				"&7It will not run a fission reactor or an Ultimate Factory bank on its own - for that you want Powah reactors or a Mekanism turbine. But as the baseline that keeps lights, sieves and storage alive with zero attention, it is the best value in the pack.&r"
